# Implementation Plan — Adaptive Performance, Security Hardening & Integrity

## Goal

Transform the binary "constrained/unconstrained" performance system into a **5-tier adaptive engine** that meets every user at their capability level — from 2G mobile to desktop on fiber. Simultaneously harden all transport, caching, encryption, and fetch layers against vulnerabilities. Surface all performance knobs in the Admin Control Panel for live tuning with instant propagation.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **This is a performance + security refactor.** Every change must be verified against the audit findings in [audit_network_optimization.md](file:///C:/Users/Rb/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e9b3d237-2b09-43b2-8bdb-6bf8baa1b2f6/audit_network_optimization.md). No regressions allowed.

