**Security checks:**
- [ ] **Cache poisoning:** Ensure SW only caches responses with `200 OK` status, valid `Content-Type`, and from same-origin
- [ ] **Scope restriction:** SW scope is `/` — verify no sub-path hijacking
- [ ] **Update propagation:** Ensure `skipWaiting()` + `clients.claim()` don't serve stale security-critical code
- [ ] **HTTPS enforcement:** SW only registers on secure contexts — verify no mixed content
- [ ] **Opaque responses:** Never cache opaque (cross-origin no-cors) responses as they can be poisoned

